for l, r, v in boosts:
    diff[l] += v
    diff[r + 1] -= v   # r+1 <= n always since r <= n-1

Then bonus[i] = prefix sum of diff[0..i], for i=0..n-1. diff[n] will have negative values for boosts ending at n-1, but they are not included in bonus[i] for i<n, so it's fine.

